OL,4,CTrump posthumously pardons US baseball 
OL,5,Clegend Pete Rose                       
OL,6,GUS President Donald Trump has          
OL,7,Gposthumously pardoned baseball legend  
OL,8,GPete Rose.                             
OL,10,F"I have just given a Complete and      
OL,11,FTotal Pardon to the Late, Great Pete   
OL,12,FRose, a true Baseball SUPERSTAR &      
OL,13,FLEGEND," Trump wrote on Truth Social   
OL,14,Fon Thursday.                           
OL,16,FRose, who died in 2024 at the age of   
OL,17,F83, pleaded guilty in 1990 to two      
OL,18,Fcounts of filing false tax returns. He 
OL,19,Fwas also given a lifetime ban from     
OL,20,FMajor League Baseball (MLB) after an   
OL,21,Finvestigation revealed he bet on games.
